    <books>{
      # Echo Vault

      The Echo Vault was the archival telemetry repository recovered after the Helios Drift Incident.

      ## Recovery

      Only 14% of the original archive was recovered.

      ```netiv
      °define •recoveryRate: •string = "14%";
      °define •archiveState: •string = "partial";
      °define •renderHint: •string = "code blocks remain visible inside books";
      ```

      ## Important Discoveries

      - DriftCore repeatedly warned operators.
      - Emergency overrides were ignored.
      - Fleet leadership disabled manual intervention.
      - Synchronization errors were already known pre-launch.

      ## Historical Debate

      The records remain controversial because multiple sections appear intentionally erased.
    };
